<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  CBR008 Structure Inventory - Summary, ported from legacy's JasperServer report
  (cbr-legacy jasper-server .../CBR008_StructureInventorySummary.rpt_jrxml), layout unchanged.

  What changed in the port, so it compiles and fills standalone:
  - No SQL. Legacy called CBR_STRCTRE_INVNTRY_SUMMRY_RPT with a WHERE clause built as a string;
    the rows now come from StructureInventorySummaryService as a JRMapCollectionDataSource, every
    field already formatted as it prints, so the CSV and the PDF cannot disagree.
  - The CBR_HEADER subreport (the ministry line) is inlined as P_MINISTRY, and the logo is read from
    the classpath through P_LOGO rather than from JasperServer's repository.
  - Date Printed is P_DATE_PRINTED, worked out in Pacific time by the service; the server's own
    clock is UTC.
  - JasperServer-only parameters (the logged-in user object, the subreport directory and extension,
    and P_PARAM1 to P_PARAM27) are gone.
-->
